        "original_id": "a7f6cca9-0084-5f13-8e06-9df34353cf78",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Herb Alpert\n- Organizations: The Reels, Creedence Clearwater Revival\n- Products: \"This Guy's in Love With You\", \"Bad Moon Rising\", \"After the News\", \"Quasimodo's Dream\"\n- Topics: Australian Kent Music Report Singles Chart\n\nFacts:\n- In July 1980, The Reels released \"After the News\" as a single from their second album \"Quasimodo's Dream\".\n- Creedence Clearwater Revival was an American rock band active in the late 1960s and early 1970s.\n- In 1982, The Reels reached No. 7 on the Australian Kent Music Report Singles Chart with their cover of Herb Alpert's \"This Guy's in Love With You\".\n- In 1986, The Reels reached No. 11 on the Australian Kent Music Report Singles Chart with their cover of Creedence Clearwater Revival's \"Bad Moon Rising\".",
